### Public self-registration (needs "Allow self-registration" in System settings → Global)

### Is self-registration enabled?
GET {{host}}/registration/status
x-Version: {{x-version}}

### Register (creates an inactive USER account and e-mails a 6-digit code)
POST {{host}}/registration/
Content-Type: application/json
x-Version: {{x-version}}

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "userName": "jane.doe",
  "password": "Str0ng!Secret"
}

### Verify the e-mailed code (activates the account)
POST {{host}}/registration/verify
Content-Type: application/json
x-Version: {{x-version}}

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Send a new code (at most one per minute; always 200 while registration is on)
POST {{host}}/registration/resend-code
Content-Type: application/json
x-Version: {{x-version}}

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com"
}
